From: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:34:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: qualcomm: implement Direct Switch ring transport

Batch uplink completion interrupts with the bounded index/refill poll timer.
Restore level-triggered completion interrupts after an empty poll so idle
transports do not spin and new bursts cannot lose their wakeup. Preserve
the shared-ring ownership, fault handling and WLAN metadata validation.

Merged from:
  0663-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-add-direct-switch-ring-transport.patch
  0664-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-coalesce-DS-index-retries.patch
  0665-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-wake-stalled-DS-refill.patch
  0666-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-expose-DS-availability.patch

Based on work by:
  JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>

Link: https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/qsdk/oss/lklm/nss-dp/-/tree/23928147cfb6f55638cc0a27f700831623ed679c
Link: https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/qsdk/oss/lklm/nss-ppe/-/tree/d53eff24bf257a8bb1b2f68beb3aa06332bfd567

